                    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>

                    <h3>1. What is BeeYarn?</h3>
                    <p>BeeYarn is a social platform that connects people through real-time messaging, video calls, and
                        discussion forums, enabling users to engage, express, and connect with like-minded individuals.
                    </p>

                    <h3>2. How can I create an account on BeeYarn?</h3>
                    <p>You can create an account by downloading the BeeYarn app from the <a
                            href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.beeyarn.beeyarn" target="_blank">Google Play
                            Store</a> (for Android users). Once downloaded, sign up using your email and basic information
                        to start using BeeYarn!</p>

                    <h3>3. Is BeeYarn free to use?</h3>
                    <p>Yes, BeeYarn is completely free to use for all users. There are no hidden fees or charges for
                        accessing the platform's core features.</p>

                    <h3>4. How do I post content on BeeYarn?</h3>
                    <p>Once logged in, you can post content directly from the app. You can share text, images, videos,
                        and participate in discussions within various forums and groups available on the platform.</p>

                    <h3>5. Can I delete my account?</h3>
                    <p>Yes, you can delete your account at any time. Go to your account settings in the BeeYarn app, and
                        you will find the option to deactivate or delete your account permanently.</p>

                    <h3>6. How do I report inappropriate content?</h3>
                    <p>If you come across content that violates BeeYarn's community guidelines, you can report it by
                        clicking the "Report" button on the post or content. Our moderation team will review the report
                        and take necessary actions.</p>

                    <h3>7. Is my personal information safe on BeeYarn?</h3>
                    <p>Yes, we take your privacy seriously. We use encryption and other security measures to protect
                        your personal information. Please review our <a href="privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for more
                        details on how we handle your data.</p>

                    <h3>8. How can I contact BeeYarn support?</h3>
                    <p>If you need assistance or have any questions, you can reach our support team at <a
                            href="mailto:support@beeyarn.com">support@beeyarn.com</a>.</p>

                    <h3>9. What should I do if I forget my password?</h3>
                    <p>If you forget your password, click on the "Forgot Password" link in the app's login screen. You
                        will receive an email with instructions to reset your password.</p>

                    <h3>10. Is there a web version of BeeYarn?</h3>
                    <p>No, BeeYarn is currently available only on mobile platforms. You can download the BeeYarn app for
                        <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.beeyarn.beeyarn" target="_blank">Android</a> devices.
                    </p>

                    <h3>11. What is the BeeYarn Creator Level System?</h3>
                    <p>The Creator Level System rewards your activity on BeeYarn with Yarn Points, which determine your creator level — a public badge displayed on your profile. Learn more on the <a href="beeyarn-creator-level-system.html">Creator Level System</a> page.</p>

                    <h3>12. What is BeeYarn's refund policy?</h3>
                    <p>For information on refunds and eligible transactions, please review our <a href="refundpolicy">Refund Policy</a>.</p>

                    <p>If you have any other questions, feel free to contact us at <a
                            href="mailto:support@beeyarn.com">support@beeyarn.com</a>.</p>

